{# ── 0.1 Web Server Setup ⚙️ ── #}
{% if current_cat == 'all' or 'deploy-server' in allowed %}
<section id="deploy-server" class="gh-docs-section">
    <h2><span class="gh-docs-num">⚙️</span> Web Server Configuration (OpenLiteSpeed / Nginx / Apache)</h2>
    <p>Point your <strong>Document Root</strong> to the <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">public_html</code> directory and ensure URL rewrites and <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">Authorization</code> headers are passed:</p>

    <h3>a) OpenLiteSpeed / CyberPanel:</h3>
    <p>In CyberPanel → Websites → Manage → vHost Conf, set the document root and rewrite rules:</p>
<pre class="gh-docs-code" dir="ltr"><code># In vHost Configuration:
docRoot                   /home/git.ysnapp.com/public_html
vhssl {
  enableContextRewrite    1
}

# .htaccess rules in public_html/.htaccess:
RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{HTTP:Authorization} ^(.*)
RewriteRule .* - [e=HTTP_AUTHORIZATION:%1]

RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteRule ^ index.php [QSA,L]</code></pre>

    <h3>b) Nginx Server Block:</h3>
<pre class="gh-docs-code" dir="ltr"><code>server {
    listen 80;
    server_name git.example.com;
    root /var/www/gitphp/public_html;
    index index.php;

    client_max_body_size 500M;

    location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.php?$query_string;
    }

    location ~ \.php$ {
        include fastcgi_params;
        fastcgi_pass unix:/run/php/php8.2-fpm.sock;
        fastcgi_param SCRIPT_FILENAME $document_root$fastcgi_script_name;
        fastcgi_param HTTP_AUTHORIZATION $http_authorization;
    }

    location ~ /\.(?!well-known).* {
        deny all;
    }
}</code></pre>

    <h3>c) Background Cron Job:</h3>
    <p>Add the recurring task in crontab to execute repository synchronizations, dispatch webhooks, and purge expired sessions:</p>
<pre class="gh-docs-code" dir="ltr"><code># Edit crontab for web user
crontab -u www-data -e

# Add one-minute background trigger:
* * * * * php /var/www/gitphp/bin/cron.php >/dev/null 2>&1</code></pre>

    <div class="gh-docs-callout info">📖 For in-depth technical deployment guides, check: <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">docs/installation.md</code> and <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">docs/deploy.md</code>.</div>
</section>
{% endif %}

