    <h2><span class="gh-docs-num">18</span> Troubleshooting</h2>
    <div class="gh-docs-callout warn">⚠️ <strong>HTTP 401 Unauthorized on Push:</strong> Ensure you are using a Personal Access Token with <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">write</code> scope, or check that your web server passes the <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">Authorization</code> header (see <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">docs/deploy.md</code>).</div>
    <div class="gh-docs-callout warn">⚠️ <strong>SSH «Permission denied (publickey)»:</strong> Verify your public key is added in Settings and run <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">php bin/fix-push.php</code> to set <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">0660</code> permissions on <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">authorized_keys</code>.</div>
    <div class="gh-docs-callout warn">⚠️ <strong>«Branch is protected» on Push:</strong> The target branch is protected against direct pushes; push to a topic branch and open a Pull Request.</div>
    <div class="gh-docs-callout warn">⚠️ <strong>Connection timeout during large pushes:</strong> Increase <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">maxReqBodySize</code> and <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">reqTimeout</code> in OpenLiteSpeed configuration (see <code class="gh-docs-inline-code">docs/openlitespeed.conf</code>).</div>
</section>
